and do it again.

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:31.958
Ah, there he is.
We got a bouncer.

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:36.429
Hopefully we get a nice one.

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:39.732
I haven’t heard the 
whales here for a little bit now.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.001
They definitely moved on.

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:44.571
Can we smell them?

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:49.142
Oh
We just got bit.

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:50.376
We’re on!

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:51.311
We're on.

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:53.279
150 seems real.

